{"id":"n14817-2-8","stage":2,"title":"동작 · 操作","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14817-2-8-1","ko":"컴퓨터에 어떤 문제가 있으신가요?","zh":"您的电脑有什么问题吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"컴퓨터에","meaning":"电脑","explanation":"컴퓨터：电脑；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"컴퓨터","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72167","senseId":"1","lemma":"컴퓨터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"컴퓨터에","audio":"/audio/05eb1db12f1d67e60f55.mp3"}},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"哪一个","explanation":"어떤：哪一个","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"2","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}},{"text":"문제가","meaning":"问题","explanation":"문제：问题；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"문제","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66246","senseId":"4","lemma":"문제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"문제가","audio":"/audio/2c69fc4d7301d4e27b45.mp3"}},{"text":"있으신가요?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；으시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있으신가요","audio":"/audio/2b73e3f1a00099b2a6b0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"cff8b01657dff709","term":"컴퓨터","zh":"电脑","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3","entryId":"72167","definition":"利用电路线快速、准确地处理文件、照片、影像等大量数据的机器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"哪一个","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问在现有的多个人或事物中，作为对象的是什么。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"bc0fca46ae9a4879","term":"문제","zh":"问题","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3","entryId":"66246","definition":"麻烦的事情或事端。","pronunciation":["문ː제"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/3942db319e096d31269d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14817-2-8-2","ko":"어제부터 갑자기 동작이 안 되고 소리도 안 나요.","zh":"从昨天开始它突然无法正常运行，也没有声音了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제부터","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제부터","audio":"/audio/fa5986b33a7131d51bc9.mp3"}},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}},{"text":"동작이","meaning":"操作，开动","explanation":"동작：操作，开动；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"동작","audio":"/audio/e0d6a8db23079de3e62e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14817","senseId":"2","lemma":"동작","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동작이","audio":"/audio/1df5277fd0c687d05eef.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"되고","meaning":"运转、正常工作","explanation":"되다：顺利进行、正常运行；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"13","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되고","audio":"/audio/73e51fe845fa66b6fb7d.mp3"}},{"text":"소리도","meaning":"声音，声，音，动静","explanation":"소리：声音，声，